      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "If ₹600 buys 20 units before and 24 after, prices are ₹30 and ₹25.\nThe price fell by 5/30=16 2/3%.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
